        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "`bdddbe16` — governance descriptor was computed then discarded before the real dispatch event",
          "anchor": "bdddbe16-governance-descriptor-was-computed-then-discarded-before-the-real-dispatch-event",
          "githubAnchor": "bdddbe16-governance-descriptor-was-computed-then-discarded-before-the-real-dispatch-event",
          "stableAnchor": "h-0a9626556083"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "`c6be1a38` — DispatchPlan approximated resolution instead of reusing it",
          "anchor": "c6be1a38-dispatchplan-approximated-resolution-instead-of-reusing-it",
          "githubAnchor": "c6be1a38-dispatchplan-approximated-resolution-instead-of-reusing-it",
          "stableAnchor": "h-bf58c44dffde"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "`5f69b274` — DispatchPlan's unavailable branch was the sole governance-shape holdout",
