          "stableAnchor": "h-d4de2789543b"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why this doesn't happen automatically",
          "anchor": "why-this-doesnt-happen-automatically",
          "githubAnchor": "why-this-doesnt-happen-automatically",
          "stableAnchor": "h-66b6cfee50ce"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Correction: a child's real merge target can skip an intermediate root entirely",
          "anchor": "correction-a-childs-real-merge-target-can-skip-an-intermediate-root-entirely",
          "githubAnchor": "correction-a-childs-real-merge-target-can-skip-an-intermediate-root-entirely",
          "stableAnchor": "h-1737c80aa2d3"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Bug (tsk-1ia): `--verify-from-children`'s generated `jq` was vacuously true",
